t and a bathroom with a shower wash basin and bath! The bedroom had lots of hanging space and was quite small, but the five-foot double bed was very comfortable. The apartment was close to perfect with exceptionally fast Wi-Fi and a table for eating or working. We really liked the place. Access is a little unusual in that you need a code to enter the property and then use electronic tags to get to the underground car park but once we were familiar with this it works well. The apartment had a pleasant good sized outdoor swimming pool but unfortunately when we were there it never stopped raining and so we weren't able to use it, nor the tennis court and pleasant garden facilities around the property. The underground car park had a marked space for our apartment but was tight with spaces quite narrow \u2013 and we had a medium sized car.", "link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g499672-d1164425-r1052415363?m=68573&staydates=2026_11_22_2026_11_23&uguests=1_2_0&supdv=desktop&supuc=MX&supul=en"}, "source_number": 100532569, "serpapi_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_hotels_reviews&hl=en&property_token=ChgI4rn5l7yGueD8ARoLL2cvMXZiOWQ3MWYQAQ&source_number=100532569"}], "serpapi_google_hotels_reviews_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_hotels_reviews&hl=en&property_token=ChgI4rn5l7yGueD8ARoLL2cvMXZiOWQ3MWYQAQ", "serpapi_google_hotels_photos_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_hotels_photos&property_token=ChgI4rn5l7yGueD8ARoLL2cvMXZiOWQ3MWYQAQ"}